Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.14,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato. 22 TL
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.14,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{opening}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.14,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,“…Day of Farewell.”
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.07,0:02:15.40,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.49,0:02:18.86,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What’s making you smile in your sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.03,0:02:22.57,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Was I smiling?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.57,0:02:25.99,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You were smiling ear-to-ear for all the world to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.99,0:02:28.29,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you have a really nice dream or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.29,0:02:29.89,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.54,0:02:32.04,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,A long time ago…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.75,0:02:34.92,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.84,0:02:37.84,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.89,0:02:46.68,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It was a really happy dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.14,0:02:52.04,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Was it a dream about the place you want to go to?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.14,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{sign}Closing Notice
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.14,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We apologize for the inconvenience, but this preschool has been closed. We humbly apologize. If you have any questions or concerns, please contact the principal, Okiura Sayaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.14,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yomogi Preschool’s principal, Okiura Sayaka
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.92,0:03:56.29,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.30,0:03:59.84,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning, Kobato-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.17,0:04:02.76,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What should I help with today?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.26,0:04:09.26,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll be going now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.26,0:04:11.23,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.77,0:04:19.57,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Isn’t it a lot to work with?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.57,0:04:22.15,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m fine! I’ll keep working!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.74,0:04:24.15,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.15,0:04:26.87,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We’ll have to throw them out if we are going to begin anew.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.70,0:04:30.29,KT,,0000,0000,0000,,Throw them out, eh…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.25,0:04:39.25,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Let’s bring these over to the entranceway.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.25,0:04:40.25,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.47,0:04:49.55,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Once we’re done with this, let’s have some tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.47,0:04:51.35,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.10,0:04:55.06,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s a little hard without Fujimoto-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.56,0:04:59.48,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san’s busy with work, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.40,0:05:05.99,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.14,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{top sign} Carry-out Nabe {Nabe = stew}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.14,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{bottom sign} Draft Beer
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.66,0:05:15.46,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You don’t have to work here if\Nyou have too much on your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.87,0:05:17.83,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,No, let me work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.42,0:05:20.63,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You don’t have to keep saving up now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.00,0:05:23.09,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If you want to fire me, just say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.09,0:05:26.47,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,No, that’s not it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.72,0:05:30.26,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You don’t get it…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.98,0:05:36.27,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.73,0:05:40.36,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,…about deciding to shut down the preschool.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.44,0:05:45.53,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But I just want you to know this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.19,0:05:49.49,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I think this is for the best now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.28,0:05:56.79,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I don’t have any regrets, since Okiura didn’t have to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.50,0:06:00.17,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,In the end, I made the decision myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.46,0:06:03.05,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s how I think of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.21,0:06:06.55,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.11,0:06:25.36,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.36,0:06:28.95,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Um, would you come to the preschool for a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.49,0:06:33.12,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Some of your stuff is still…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.12,0:06:33.83,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,There isn’t any.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.54,0:06:37.87,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I don’t care if you throw it all away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.87,0:06:38.66,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.66,0:06:40.33,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m busy, so I won’t go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.14,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{sign} Pedestrians and Bikes Only
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.98,0:07:05.86,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s Fujimoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.86,0:07:09.32,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, but I’ll be about an hour late.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.14,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{closing sign}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.36,0:07:56.07,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.66,0:08:40.20,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Watch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.17,0:08:53.84,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{CCS character… ;;}Huh? I heard you were going to be late today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.47,0:08:56.09,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I finished early.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.15,0:09:16.03,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What kind of meek face is that? {Keeper: Not sure what other word to use. | orig line “What kind of mushy face is that for?“}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.03,0:09:19.16,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You’re making me all sad and gloomy, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.62,0:09:22.41,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.37,0:09:26.33,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What’re you thinking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.04,0:09:28.75,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.75,0:09:32.42,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I don’t know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.09,0:09:34.13,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.55,0:09:35.51,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.93,0:09:39.76,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It hurts here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.72,0:09:43.64,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Now that the preschool is closed…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.35,0:09:47.64,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But Sayaka-sensei said it was for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.35,0:09:49.40,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yet…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.57,0:09:54.07,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.86,0:09:56.86,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.36,0:09:59.28,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.66,0:10:01.95,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What’s with that reaction?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.87,0:10:05.70,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You haven’t realized it yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.00,0:10:10.96,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeesh, for crying out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.14,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,16 eyecatch}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.36,0:10:34.82,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kiyokazu-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.44,0:10:37.03,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.03,0:10:38.70,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you working today, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.70,0:10:39.36,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.36,0:10:43.37,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But today’s the day they’re taking down the preschool building{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.37,0:10:44.87,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.29,0:10:49.87,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You could at least take a break today…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.00,0:10:51.75,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Now then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.25,0:10:56.34,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,The neighbor’s left, so I’ll be off too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.34,0:10:58.17,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You’re going out?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.17,0:11:00.09,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I’ll be back tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.51,0:11:04.18,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t make that face!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.18,0:11:05.10,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.10,0:11:05.85,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.22,0:11:08.64,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You better get going too. You’ll be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.64,0:11:10.10,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.69,0:11:13.61,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, all right, all right…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.61,0:11:14.86,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.61,0:11:17.86,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.65,0:11:21.20,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sensei, did you pack up everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.20,0:11:23.74,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We brought it all out yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.16,0:11:27.83,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Then we can get to work right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.83,0:11:30.33,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What about that mean-looking guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.33,0:11:31.75,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,He’s working.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.75,0:11:34.13,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What? What an anti-social.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.79,0:11:37.90,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,He’s so cold, despite this place taking care of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.90,0:11:39.40,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,He’s not cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.55,0:11:44.64,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san is… busy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.26,0:11:50.27,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,R-Right…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.27,0:11:51.77,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.27,0:11:56.48,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Okiura-san asked me to give my regards.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.44,0:11:59.40,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Since he won’t be able to come for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.40,0:12:01.61,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, I heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.49,0:12:05.49,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,There’s a lot to handle with the higher-ups.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.49,0:12:08.62,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s all stuff none of us in the\Nlower ends would know though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.16,0:12:11.75,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Th-Then is Okiura-san…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.75,0:12:14.37,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t worry. It’ll work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.37,0:12:16.63,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s Okiura-san, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.96,0:12:19.88,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.88,0:12:21.76,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.76,0:12:23.22,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.22,0:12:24.63,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What’s wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.63,0:12:27.68,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Um… today is goodbye…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.68,0:12:28.93,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,So we came to visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.93,0:12:31.81,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I told my mom I was coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.81,0:12:32.98,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.98,0:12:34.06,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.73,0:12:37.15,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Boss, can I start?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.06,0:12:40.69,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sensei, can we start?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.67,0:12:57.04,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.17,0:13:01.34,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on now. It’s dangerous, so let’s stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.34,0:13:03.21,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.21,0:13:05.34,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.58,0:13:34.79,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Bye bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.21,0:13:45.72,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll tell you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.38,0:13:48.47,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That one’s impossible to convince.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.22,0:13:53.35,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Give it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.31,0:13:59.02,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Genko-sama, that’s unfair!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.02,0:14:00.77,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You all started having snacks without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.77,0:14:02.32,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Time to eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.23,0:14:05.65,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Zuishou, shut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.24,0:14:14.68,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You’re going to catch Ushagi-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.45,0:14:19.81,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right. I’ll take Ushagi-san\Nhostage and talk it over with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.08,0:14:23.96,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you really think God will be willing to trade?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.96,0:14:26.51,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s better than doing nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.22,0:14:31.32,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if we do understand your reasons, it’s not a contract to be taken lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.01,0:14:33.97,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Ginsei’s right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.97,0:14:36.81,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You seem to be a lot more fired up than you used to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.94,0:14:44.09,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We can discuss semantics later!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.59,0:14:46.65,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Get a grip!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.65,0:14:48.99,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Didn’t you learn anything from last time?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.99,0:14:50.15,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.70,0:14:53.12,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you want to try forcing it again?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.12,0:14:57.75,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If you don’t know who’s hurting from this, I’ll show you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.58,0:15:02.67,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.88,0:15:12.47,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,God probably wanted you to learn how to wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.89,0:15:16.93,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, that certainly is something I’m bad at doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.93,0:15:17.72,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.31,0:15:22.15,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I know. I won’t do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.81,0:16:07.40,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I am Iorogi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.19,0:16:11.03,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,The one who will be with you from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.42,0:16:30.59,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sensei, once we finish cleaning up, there’ll be no trespassing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.59,0:16:31.71,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.71,0:16:33.17,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for the work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.17,0:16:35.72,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Sensei, you guys take care, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.72,0:16:36.64,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.56,0:16:50.86,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I thought it was a pretty vast place, but now that I see it like this…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.15,0:16:53.11,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.70,0:17:03.62,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan, I’ve got a favor to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.08,0:17:04.96,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Can I?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.58,0:17:07.63,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.33,0:17:11.90,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Help out Fujimoto-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.30,0:17:18.76,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,The preschool might have been holding him back. {Keeper: orig line “The preschool might have been binding him up.“}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.55,0:17:21.39,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s what I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.39,0:17:25.02,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Holding him back? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.44,0:17:29.90,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,By making Fujimoto-kun remain “hard-working Fujimoto-kun.”
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.65,0:17:37.16,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I was relying on Fujimoto-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.82,0:17:41.66,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I should have noticed it earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.58,0:17:47.42,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,450)}Thanks for the help, Fujimoto-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.25,0:17:52.92,KP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,500)}Kiyokazu-sensei, play the organ!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.35,0:18:11.69,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I should have told him to work towards what he wanted to do for himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.69,0:18:15.86,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,No! But Fujimoto-san was really doing his best to…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.78,0:18:20.20,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. All the more reason to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.78,0:18:23.49,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Because he works too hard…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.95,0:18:27.21,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s why, Kobato-chan…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.62,0:18:29.46,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Take care of Fujimoto-kun. {You should sleep with Fujimoto-kun.}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.04,0:18:31.63,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Stay by his side.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.13,0:18:33.71,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What about you, Sayaka-sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.46,0:18:36.92,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s not for me to do. {I’m not a cougar.}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.38,0:18:40.05,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.77,0:18:51.06,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.60,0:18:52.86,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.27,0:18:54.86,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m home!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.19,0:18:56.36,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.36,0:18:57.44,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Bad news!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.58,0:19:08.79,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Doumoto, you…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.96,0:19:14.13,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,As promised, I didn’t contact the people at Yomogi Preschool.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.13,0:19:16.13,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But I did call your landlady.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.38,0:19:18.88,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, Kobato-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.26,0:19:21.43,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I didn’t want to worry you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.84,0:19:23.39,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Worrying about him would{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.29,0:19:50.16,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Um… your arm…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.21,0:19:57.67,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Th-Thank goodness that your injuries weren’t severe…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.09,0:20:00.42,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t push yourself so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.42,0:20:01.76,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You’ll worry everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.01,0:20:08.81,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It must be inconvenient when you can’t use your arm, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.81,0:20:11.54,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Please tell me if there’s anything I can help with!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.15,0:20:24.11,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I told you the first time we met at Yomogi Preschool.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.74,0:20:29.20,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop being so sympathetic and curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.83,0:20:36.88,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If you pity me, stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.42,0:20:38.21,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s not{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.21,0:20:39.30,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s annoying!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.34,0:20:47.05,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s not it, Fujimoto-sa…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.31,0:20:59.48,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s not it…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.80,0:21:31.39,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,For me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.19,0:21:42.86,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s telling you to finish gathering confetti by the next full moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.86,0:21:48.36,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If you don’t, it means you accept your fate in accordance with the contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.28,0:21:51.83,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Ushagi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.54,0:21:56.75,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,How can we extend that deadline?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.96,0:22:00.46,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What’ll happen now?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.09,0:22:02.63,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What should we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.63,0:22:05.13,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Who knows. It’s up to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.63,0:22:08.80,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Although I feel some sense of responsibility for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.14,0:22:12.31,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If it weren’t for that battle, that girl wouldn’t have…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.89,0:22:19.31,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,…gotten hit by accident, and have to go through all this, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.98,0:22:22.57,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll do anything I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.57,0:22:25.90,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Just give us another four seasons…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.90,0:22:28.15,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,No, one is enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.78,0:22:30.82,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.67,0:22:42.34,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You won’t?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.59,0:22:44.63,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.14,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{ending}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.14,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,“…Kobato’s Wish.”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.14,0:00:05.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
